WEBVTT - Skillspector (narration, English)

1
00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:09.759
A skill is text your AI agent follows. One hidden line can leak a key or pipe a script into a shell.

2
00:00:10.859 --> 00:00:15.652
Skillspector reads every agent skill before your AI does.

3
00:00:16.902 --> 00:00:23.080
Each finding shows its severity, its location, the matched text and what to check.

4
00:00:24.130 --> 00:00:29.341
Checks never change a skill. An administrator decides what to hide.

5
00:00:30.391 --> 00:00:38.058
Fifteen built-in rules look for prompt injection, exposed keys, risky commands and licence problems.

6
00:00:39.658 --> 00:00:43.720
Skillspector. An administrator always decides.
